   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>I was looking at aragon’s discord and i like this channel they have where they see all pull requests, it’s really easy to do, but you have to have permissions on github i think.<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox stackexchange\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://superuser.com/questions/1189901/can-i-integrate-a-discord-channel-with-github-pull-requests\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">superuser.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<a href=\"https://superuser.com/users/358766/stevoisiak\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Stevoisiak\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/b24309b681a501185afc64dc0a26385e59c41cb7.png\" width=\"128\"/>\n</a>\n<h4>\n<a href=\"https://superuser.com/questions/1189901/can-i-integrate-a-discord-channel-with-github-pull-requests\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Can I integrate a Discord channel with GitHub pull requests?</a>\n</h4>\n<div class=\"tags\">\n<strong>github, discord</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"date\">\n  asked by\n  \n  <a href=\"https://superuser.com/users/358766/stevoisiak\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">\n    Stevoisiak\n  </a>\n  on <a href=\"https://superuser.com/questions/1189901/can-i-integrate-a-discord-channel-with-github-pull-requests\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">04:36AM - 18 Mar 17 UTC</a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<br/>\nand here’s a pic of how it looks<br/>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50.png\" title=\"image\"><img alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"wIqGTNzWz6d7Y3ptQlcsU0klVQY\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50_2_345x500.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50_2_345x500.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50_2_517x750.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/e54b4f6478a0efa2e088fe3b5def736876aa9e50.png 2x\" width=\"345\"/><div class=\"meta\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">548×793 74.7 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div>",
