   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 0,
   "cooked": "<p><span class=\"hashtag\">#1</span> Moving to our own discord</p>\n<p>Separating from the general token engineering community? Personally I’m hesitant on that, I love the comprehensive community that is TE, I think it’s so cool that the commons and the academy are in one place. Is there a forum post or other resource dedicated to this discussion?</p>",
