   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 0,
   "cooked": "<p>I’m on board with trying this out!</p>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/krisj\">@KrisJ</a> has looked at zappier as a solution to have github notifications (mentions specifically) sent to Discord DMs though it was too pricey to implement. But this could be really useful too.</p>",
